  <item>
    <title>迪幻腕掰腕 Ep 27：从D23带回来的声音、回忆、快乐和感动</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a92b4f68e912c9d31791157</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a92b4f68e912c9d31791157</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 29 Aug 2026 10:23:09 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><span>好久不见！最近迪幻成员WaitinZ和ReiRei在美国安纳海姆参加了今年的D23迪士尼全球粉丝大会，有一些来自现场的难忘回忆和感受，想要在这期播客里分享给大家。</span></p><span></span><p class="wp-block-paragraph"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="28">0:28</a> 迪幻成员相聚在安纳海姆，ReiRei分享第一次参加D23的感受</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="210">3:30</a> D23逐年演变中，不变的是以粉丝为中心的主旨</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="688">11:28</a> 迪士尼传奇奖颁奖典礼上的感人时刻</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="854">14:14</a> 与《怪诞小镇》主创Alex Hirsch见面的幕后故事</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1521">25:21</a> 此次公布的影视和体验新消息，哪些值得重点期待？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1988">33:08</a> 买票、排队、购物、见明星……参加D23的经验之谈</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2448">40:48</a> 明年在新加坡会有亚洲版D23</span></p><span></span><p class="wp-block-paragraph"><span>《迪幻腕掰腕》是一档由迪幻团队制作的播客节目，每期由几位迪幻成员一起掰扯有关迪士尼电影、剧集、动画、乐园等迪士尼粉丝关注的一切，以及迪幻成员感兴趣的其他内容。</span></p><span></span><p class="wp-block-paragraph"><span>你可以在以下平台订阅《迪幻腕掰腕》，第一时间收听新节目：</span><br><a href="https://music.163.com/#/djradio?id=794386475" data-url="https://music.163.com/#/djradio?id=794386475"><span>网易云音乐</span></a><span> | </span><a href="https://open.spotify.com/show/5MaZpoBIV0h9VxSkuwBV2Y" data-url="https://open.spotify.com/show/5MaZpoBIV0h9VxSkuwBV2Y"><span>Spotify</span></a><span> | </span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/5f5f2e9983c34e85ddd31c0d?s=eyJ1IjogIjVlOGM3ODdmZTAzNmM0MzE3OTU2M2JhMiJ9" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/5f5f2e9983c34e85ddd31c0d?s=eyJ1IjogIjVlOGM3ODdmZTAzNmM0MzE3OTU2M2JhMiJ9"><span>小宇宙</span></a><span> | </span><a href="https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/%E8%BF%AA%E5%B9%BB%E8%85%95%E6%8E%B0%E8%85%95/id1493124945" data-url="https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/%E8%BF%AA%E5%B9%BB%E8%85%95%E6%8E%B0%E8%85%95/id1493124945"><span>Apple Podcast</span></a><span> | </span><a href="https://www.ximalaya.com/yingshi/32019631/" data-url="https://www.ximalaya.com/yingshi/32019631/"><span>喜马拉雅</span></a><span> | </span><a href="https://deefun.com/feed/podcast/" data-url="https://deefun.com/feed/podcast/"><span>RSS订阅</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://deefun.com/202608/6664/" data-url="https://deefun.com/202608/6664/"><span>迪幻腕掰腕 Ep 27：从D23带回来的声音、回忆、快乐和感动</span></a><span>最先出现在</span><a href="https://deefun.com" data-url="https://deefun.com"><span>迪幻 Deefun</span></a><span>。</span></p>]]></description>
